{"product_id":"gwendolen","title":"Gwendolen","description":"\u003cp\u003eI was winning when I met your gaze . . .  So begins the confession of Gwendolen Harleth: dazzling beauty, wilful vivant and gambler of hearts: who bet her strength against her cruel husband, staked it all on the love of Daniel Deronda, and played her way back to a winning hand.  With the profound insight of her acclaimed biographies, Diana Souhami fashions a real life for this most mercurial and magnetic of literary heroines, plotting Gwendolen's course in step with the drama of the age as a pioneer of women's aspirations in our own.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 128 x 196\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Diana Souhami\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781782063551\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 304\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45885674225817,"sku":"14RA9781782063551","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/69145819bc042_Gwendolen.jpg?v=1762964614","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/gwendolen","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}